e\\BackWeb\\Communication` 键的读取权限仅为 SYSTEM 和 Administrators，移除普通用户的读取权限，防止密码泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=91487886514546&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1565","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1277.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1277","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1277.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1277.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-76mc-rpwg-m8ch/GHSA-76mc-rpwg-m8ch.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87797/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1277.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/be7ad03fdf3a412f0fd57a25f1732dc0ecfb1cb3/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1446.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0371","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0371.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0188","title":"Sun Solaris passwd 命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Solaris 系统中的 passwd 命令存在拒绝服务漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 passwd 命令发送特制输入或触发异常状态，导致 passwd 进程崩溃或系统认证服务不可用，进而使得合法用户无法正常修改密码，影响系统正常运维。该漏洞影响多个 Solaris 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用条件相对有限，但成功利用后可能导致系统认证功能瘫痪。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0188"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-12-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:47Z","remediation":"建议升级到已修复此漏洞的 Solaris 版本（如 Solaris 2.6 及以上补丁版本），或安装 Sun 提供的对应安全补丁。临时缓解措施可限制非授权用户对 passwd 命令的执行权限，或通过文件系统 ACL 控制 /usr/bin/passwd 的访问范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/182"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0371.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0290","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0290.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0139","title":"Sun Solaris x86 mkcookie 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris x86 系统中的 mkcookie 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该程序传递特製的参数触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖内存中的返回地址或函数指针，从而获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris x86 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用此漏洞提权至 root。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0139"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-12-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:40Z","remediation":"安装 Sun 官方安全补丁 106980-01 (Solaris 2.5.1) 或 106981-01 (Solaris 2.6)。如无法打补丁，立即移除 `mkcookie` 的 setuid root 权限：`chmod 0555 /usr/bin/mkcookie`，或直接删除该程序。限制本地普通用户登录受影响系统作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/8205"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0290.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1450","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1450.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1282","title":"RealNetworks RealSystem G2 Server 权限提升漏洞","description":"RealSystem G2 服务器将管理员密码以明文形式存储于全局可读取的配置文件中，导致本地攻击者可通过读取该配置文件获取管理员权限。该漏洞允许已获得本地系统访问权限的低权限用户直接窃取管理员凭据，进而实现权限提升。受影响的版本包括 RealSystem G2 及可能的相关组件，危害等级中等，建议立即修改文件权限并升级至安全版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1282"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-12-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:06Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealSystem G2 至官方修复版本（如 RealSystem G2 6.0.3 及更高版本），或迁移至 RealNetworks 后续支持的 Helix Server 系列。同时将配置文件权限设置为仅管理员可读（chmod 600），并移除其他用户的读取权限。如产品已停止维护，建议替换为其他流媒体服务器软件（如 Wowza Streaming Engine 或 Nginx-RTMP）以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/11543","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1542","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bab2ad77526cf53e031dbf06b248b9bb97c66bc2/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1282.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1282","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1282.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/929f101fd7b4d4314a4b92f62a8cc2523c6d76f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1282.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3wj4-jxxp-h483/GHSA-3wj4-jxxp-h483.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87841/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1282.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/0bc422e082b7e01390f70e5565b0c87d6b52007c/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1450.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1445","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1445.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1276","title":"fte fte-console 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"fte 软件包中的 fte-console 组件在处理虚拟控制台设备时未能正确释放 root 权限，存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞，通过虚拟控制台设备获取 root 权限，进而完全控制系统。该漏洞影响 fte 0.46b-4.1 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。默认配置下存在风险，需要本地访问权限才能利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1276"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-12-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:05Z","remediation":"升级 fte 软件包至 0.46b-4.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 fte-console 未正确丢弃 root 权限的问题。如无法升级，可移除 fte-console 的 SUID 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/fte-console）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/1998/19981207","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1609","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1276.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1276","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1276.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1276.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m7p3-x2g8-59r3/GHSA-m7p3-x2g8-59r3.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87752/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1276.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/1998/19981207.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000401.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1445.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1361","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1361.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1147","title":"Platinum Policy Compliance Manager 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Platinum Policy Compliance Manager (PCM) 7.0 的 smaxagent.exe 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 Agent 服务端口（1827/TCP）发送超长字符串触发该漏洞，导致任意命令执行。攻击无需身份认证，可完全控制受影响系统，危害严重。受影响版本为 PCM 7.0，建议升级至最新版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1147"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-12-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:49Z","remediation":"联系 Platinum（后被 Computer Associates 收购）获取官方热修复补丁，升级至修复后的 PCM 版本。如无法升级，在防火墙或主机层面屏蔽 TCP 端口 1827，阻止外部向 smaxagent.exe 服务发送数据，以降低远程利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91273739726314&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/3164","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1430","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1147.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1147","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1147.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9b79b5eac5a874eeb91f0d9e37084feed8b830f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1147.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8vpv-fc53-gxvg/GHSA-8vpv-fc53-gxvg.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88455/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1147.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-1999.jsonl","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/6833d28df9070f3a228f6256470bee59e545f901/advisories/2022/04/EUVD-1999-1128.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1361.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1154","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1154.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0798","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":16271,\"outputTokens\":42,\"totalTokens\":16313}}","description":"bootpd（BOOTP 服务器守护进程）在 OpenBSD、FreeBSD 及 Linux 等操作系统上存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向运行 bootpd 服务的目标发送包含异常构造的 header type 字段的特制数据包，触发缓冲区溢出，从而可能执行任意代码或导致服务崩溃。该漏洞影响提供 BOOTP/DHCP 服务的系统，攻击者无需凭据即可在远程发起利用，危害严重。建议系统管理员升级至已修复该漏洞的最新版本或应用厂商发布的安全补丁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0798"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-12-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:04Z","remediation":"立即为受影响系统应用安全补丁：OpenBSD 2.4 用户请升级至 OpenBSD 2.5 或应用 1998 年 11 月 28 日发布的 bootpd.patch（ftp://ftp.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/patches/2.4/common/bootpd.patch）；FreeBSD 用户请升级至最新安全分支并更新 bootpd 端口；Linux 发行版用户请通过包管理器更新 dhcp/bootp 相关软件包。如无需 bootpd 服务，可直接在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释掉 bootps 行并重启 inetd，或在防火墙层面禁用 UDP 67/68 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91278867118128&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe807f4098db5a5ad8dcb41a479197724cb9e789/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0798.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0798","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0798.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/404b484bd5d19c483528cbf4559074858313076b/data/1999/CVE-1999-0798.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f61040ac78eb76aff0a3a68a8a8a4562940d3711/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ghpg-95cp-r25j/GHSA-ghpg-95cp-r25j.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0798.json","https://github.com/fosslight/fosslight/blob/4b9c95f462f87d3bb7703c29e88e9330275b06c4/migration/migration/scripts/20241104111630_update_v2.1.0_update_license_data.sql"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1154.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1448","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1448.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1280","title":"Hummingbird Exceed 开发测试 DLL 泄露明文密码漏洞","description":"Hummingbird Exceed 6.0.1.0 版本错误地包含了一个本应用于开发和测试的 DLL 组件，该组件会将用户输入的用户名和密码以明文形式记录到 test.log 日志文件中。攻击者若能获取服务器文件系统访问权限或通过其他方式读取该日志文件，即可直接获取用户凭据，进而实施进一步攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1280"],"sources":["cve","nvd"],"published":"1998-12-03T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"删除或限制 test.log 日志文件的访问权限，移除不必要的开发和测试 DLL 组件，并升级到 Hummingbird Exceed 不受影响的版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T10:17:50Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/11512","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1547"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1448.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1231","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1231.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0937","title":"BNBForm 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"BNBForm 是一款基于 CGI 的表单处理程序，其 automessage 隐藏表单变量存在设计缺陷。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向该变量传递恶意路径参数，读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者可以获取系统配置文件、数据库凭证等关键数据。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0937"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-12-03T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"BNBForm 已停止维护，建议立即停止使用该程序，迁移至现代表单处理方案，并对服务器进行安全审计排查是否已被利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0937","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-0937.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aa3114da1227373bef7855dba21bcaa5f0e0ad76/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0937.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0937","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b4ddb28f94d250449ab64c1617f45b1f91701fa2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0937.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0937.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2339193e1c10dc2db330718adeb8cc8d88c4dd/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5wmg-pfqm-4c3w/GHSA-5wmg-pfqm-4c3w.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0937.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/dangerous_cgis.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1231.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1231.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1229","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1229.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0936","title":"BNBSurvey survey.cgi 命令注入漏洞","description":"BNBSurvey 的 survey.cgi 程序存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 HTTP 请求参数中插入 shell 元字符（如管道符、分号等）来执行任意系统命令，导致服务器被完全控制。攻击无需身份认证，通过网络即可触发，危害极大。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0936"],"sources":["cve","epss"],"published":"1998-12-03T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"BNBSurvey 已停止维护，建议立即下线该程序或移除 survey.cgi 脚本。如必须使用，应对用户输入进行严格过滤，禁止 shell 元字符（|;&`$(){}[]<>）传入系统命令调用接口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T02:56:38Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0936"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1229.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1182","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1182.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0836","title":"SCO UnixWare uidadmin 本地符号链接权限提升漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.0/7.0.1/7.1/7.1.1 系统中的 uidadmin 程序存在本地权限提升漏洞。该程序在运行时会以 root 权限处理用户可控的文件路径，攻击者可通过创建指向敏感系统文件（如 /etc/passwd）的符号链接，诱使 uidadmin 以 root 身份写入或覆盖目标文件。攻击条件为本地普通用户账户，利用门槛低，成功后可获得 root 权限，造成系统完全沦陷。此漏洞由 symlink 竞争条件引发，属于典型的本地提权类安全问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0836"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-12-02T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 SCO UnixWare 7.1.3 或更高版本（已修复该 symlink 漏洞）；若无法升级，立即移除 uidadmin 的 SUID 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/uidadmin），并限制普通用户对 /var/opt/K/SCO/UnixWare/ 目录的写入权限，防止本地提权利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/842","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=19991202160111.205